  "construction_notes": [
    {
      "text": "Planning Commission approved; appeal status not checked.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-001488"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "City Legistar names 4Terra Investments as applicant and Desmond Family Real Estate Limited Partners as owner. The January 2026 version (file 26-0304) was 29 townhome-style condominiums plus one live-work unit; the approved version (26-0710) is 30 townhomes in five three-story buildings with a vesting map for 30 condominium units.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-001488",
        "SRC-003707"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Project data table: 52,474 sq ft lot (1.20 acres), 30 units at 25 du/ac (29 base plus density bonus), 17 three-bedroom and 13 four-bedroom units of 2,204 to 3,034 sq ft, 33 ft 6 in tall, 63 parking spaces, FAR 134%. Several setback, coverage and design standards are waived under State Density Bonus Law.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-003705"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Applicant counsel letter: ownership project under the Density Bonus Law; 15% inclusionary obligation (4.35 units) met with 4 on-site units at 120% AMI plus a fee on the fraction; 10% density bonus elected as one unit; 11 waivers requested.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-003706"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The 2024 IS/MND evaluated 62 units and 7,579 sq ft of commercial on the two parcels. The 2026 Notice of Determination says the 898 E. Fremont Ave parcel (309-10-026) was approved for a separate development and describes the 30 townhouses on 1313 S. Wolfe Road; the city's 2026 Legistar item lists both 309-10-026 and 309-10-027 for this project.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-003708",
        "SRC-003709",
        "SRC-001488"
      ]
    }
  ],
